<div class="text-center">
    <p>開始設計！首先選擇類型與欄位，然後點擊「新增(Add)」即可在繪製區域產生新的標籤元件(Time to design! Start by selecting a type and field. Then click 'add' to generate your new label element in the draw area.)。</p>
    <p>您可以依需求自由新增、拖曳、自訂、調整大小以及刪除元件。強烈建議包含帶有唯一識別碼（如 plot_name、plant_name 等）的條碼(Add, drag, customize, resize, and delete as many elements as you like. A barcode containing your unique identifier (plot_name, plant_name, etc) is strongly recommended.)。</p>
</div>
</br>
<div class="col-md-12" id="d3-draw-div" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="col-md-offset-2 col-md-8" id="d3-draw-area"></div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-12">
    <center>
        <h4>新增元件(Add Elements):</h4>
    </center>
</div>
<div class="col-md-12" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="col-md-3" id="d3-add-type-div">
        <center>
            <label>類型(Type):</label><br>
            <select id="d3-add-type-input" class="form-control"></select>&nbsp&nbsp
        </center>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-3" id="d3-add-field-div">
        <center>
            <label>欄位(Field):</label><br>
            <select id="d3-add-field-input" class="form-control"></select><br>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="d3-custom-field">建立自訂欄位(Create Custom Field)</button>
        </center>
        &nbsp&nbsp
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-2" id="d3-add-size-div">
        <center>
            <label>大小(Size):</label><br>
            <input class="form-control" id="d3-add-size-input" type="number"></input>
            <input class="form-control" id="d3-add-size-slider" type="range"></input>
        </center>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-3" id="d3-add-font-div">
        <center>
            <label>字型(Font):</label><br>
            <select id="d3-add-font-input" class="form-control"></select>&nbsp
        </center>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-1">
        <center>
            <br>
            <button class="btn btn-primary d3-add" id="d3-add">新增(Add)</button>
        </center>
    </div>
</div>
